# e2e run outputs (the harness CODE is committed; individual runs are not —
# transcripts are large and a run is reproducible from the harness).
# Renamed from tests/bench/results/ on 2026-08-19: the stale path silently
# stopped ignoring anything, and a `git add tests/` swept 208k lines of
# transcripts into the rename commit before the diffstat was read.
